menu "Smoke Bridge — smoke_x"
    config SMOKEBRIDGE_RESCAN_ENABLED
        bool "Re-scan for a base after 60 min of silence with no active cook"
        default n
        help
            Off by default deliberately (design 02 §2.7): silently
            re-pairing to a different base station would be worse than
            staying put. Never engages during an active cook either way.
endmenu
